---
// Ashly 3.0 Welcome / Hero Component
---

<section
  class="relative pt-8 pb-20 md:pt-14 md:pb-28 overflow-hidden bg-transparent"
>
  <!-- Ambient glow orbs -->
  <div
    class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[850px] h-[450px] bg-sky-600/15 blur-[150px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute top-1/3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[550px] h-[400px] bg-purple-600/15 blur-[140px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <div
    class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center flex flex-col items-center"
  >
    <!-- Badge -->
    <div
      class="hero-badge inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900/90 border border-ashly-cyan/40 text-xs text-ashly-cyan font-mono shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(23,184,254,0.15)] mb-6 sm:mb-8"
    >
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-ashly-cyan animate-ping"></span>
      ASISTENTE VIRTUAL IA CON PRESENCIA 3D &amp; AUTOMATIZACIÓN LOCAL
    </div>

    <!-- Main Title (Properly closed, perfectly spaced) -->
    <h1
      class="hero-title text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.25rem] font-sora font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.14] max-w-5xl mx-auto select-none"
    >
      <span class="block">
        <span
          class="hero-word inline-block will-change-transform cursor-default"
          >Tu</span
        >{" "}
        <span
          class="hero-word inline-block will-change-transform cursor-default"
          >compañera</span
        >{" "}
        <span
          class="hero-word inline-block will-change-transform cursor-default"
          >inteligente</span
        >{" "}
        <span
          class="hero-word inline-block will-change-transform cursor-default"
          >que</span
        >
      </span>
      <span class="block mt-2 sm:mt-3">
        <span
          class="hero-word hero-highlight inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-ashly-cyan via-sky-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent filter drop-shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(23,184,254,0.45)] will-change-transform cursor-default"
        >
          Opera en tu ordenador.
        </span>{" "}
      </span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Justified Description Text (Generous vertical space between title and description) -->
    <p
      class="hero-desc text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light text-justify [text-align-last:center] mt-8 sm:mt-11 mb-8 sm:mb-11"
    >
      Ejecuta herramientas nativas en bucle, abre software, recuerda tus
      proyectos y reacciona emocionalmente en tiempo real mediante su avatar 3D
      interactivo. Conmutable al instante entre <strong
        class="text-white font-medium">Google Gemini Flash-Lite</strong
      > y <strong class="text-white font-medium">Modelos Locales</strong> sin censura
      ni pérdida de privacidad.
    </p>

    <!-- System Badges Feature -->
    <div
      class="hero-badges flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5 mb-8 sm:mb-11 text-xs font-mono"
    >
      <span
        class="hero-badge-item px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#0b132b] text-sky-300 border border-sky-800/60 flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm"
      >
        🤖 Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite
      </span>
      <span
        class="hero-badge-item px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#1c0e35] text-purple-300 border border-purple-800/60 flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm"
      >
        💻 Modo Local (Ollama / GGUF)
      </span>
      <span
        class="hero-badge-item px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-[#08221b] text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-800/60 flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm"
      >
        🛡️ Auditoría Inmutable
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- CTAs (Generous spacing for download button) -->
    <div
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-3"
    >
      <a
        class="hero-cta-btn w-full sm:w-auto px-10 py-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-ashly-cyan to-blue-600 hover:from-sky-300 hover:to-blue-500 text-slate-950 font-bold font-sora text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-3 shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(23,184,254,0.45)] transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95"
        href="#descarga"
      >
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            d="M0 3.449L9.75 2.1v9.451H0m10.949-9.602L24 0v11.4H10.949M0 12.6h9.75v9.451L0 20.699M10.949 12.6H24V24l-13.051-1.802"
          ></path></svg
        >
        <span>Descargar Ashly para Windows</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="hero-subtext text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
      Versión 1.0.0 • 64-bit • Sin telemetría oculta
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- END: FeatureWindowsGallery -->

<!-- Transición Cinemática 1: AUDITORÍA (Zoom Frontal 30x / Warp Speed) -->
<div
  class="transition-scene-1 relative w-full h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden pointer-events-none select-none bg-transparent"
>
  <div
    class="zoom-warp-content flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-4 will-change-transform max-w-full"
  >
    <div
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-500/30 text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-6"
    >
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      Seguridad &amp; Transparencia
    </div>
    <h2
      class="zoom-warp-heading font-sora font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[7vw] text-white uppercase tracking-wider leading-none will-change-transform max-w-full px-4 text-center inline-block"
    >
      AUDITORÍA
    </h2>
    <p
      class="text-slate-400 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mt-4"
    >
      [ Registro Inmutable de Memoria ]
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- BEGIN: SecurityAndMemorySection -->
<!-- Dedicated section meticulously replicating Screenshot Image 2 -->
<section class="py-10 sm:py-14 bg-transparent overflow-hidden" id="auditoria">
  <div class="section-zoom-target max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <span
        class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-500/30"
        >Seguridad &amp; Transparencia Absoluta</span
      >
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-sora font-extrabold text-white mt-3">
        Registro de Auditoría de Solo Lectura
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2">
        Cada acción, filtro de intención y ejecución de programas se audita en
        una base inmutable. Sabrás exactamente qué comandos y herramientas
        ejecutó el Planner.
      </p>
    </div>
    <!-- Software Window Mockup: Gestor de Memoria y Aprendizaje (Updated Design) -->
    <div
      class="rounded-xl border border-cyan-900/60 bg-[#030612] shadow-window overflow-hidden"
    >
      <!-- Window Title Bar -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#050e1d] px-4 py-3 border-b border-cyan-900/80 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 select-none"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div
            class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-cyan-950/90 border border-cyan-500/50 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 text-base shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(23,184,254,0.3)]"
          >
            🧠
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-sora font-bold text-white tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
              GESTIÓN DE MEMORIA Y APRENDIZAJE
            </h3>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-400/80">Ashly Core System • v2.4.0</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Status Badges & Window Controls -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 flex-wrap">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#09152b] border border-cyan-900/70 text-slate-300 font-mono text-[11px] flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-cyan-400">💬</span> 36 Mensajes
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#09152b] border border-cyan-900/70 text-slate-300 font-mono text-[11px] flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-amber-400">💡</span> 52 Lecciones
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#09152b] border border-cyan-900/70 text-slate-300 font-mono text-[11px] flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-purple-400">⚙️</span> 0 Presets
            </span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#09152b] border border-cyan-900/70 text-slate-300 font-mono text-[11px] flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-emerald-400">😐</span> Neutro Emoción
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400 text-xs font-mono pl-2 border-l border-cyan-950">
            <span class="hover:text-white cursor-pointer px-1">─</span>
            <span class="hover:text-white cursor-pointer px-1">□</span>
            <span class="hover:text-red-400 cursor-pointer px-1">✕</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Upper Tabs Navigation -->
      <div
        class="bg-[#040a16] px-4 pt-2.5 border-b border-cyan-950 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 select-none text-xs"
      >
        <button
          type="button"
          class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-t-lg bg-[#061021] text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-x border-transparent transition-colors"
        >
          <span>💬</span> Historial
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-t-lg bg-[#061021] text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-x border-transparent transition-colors"
        >
          <span>💡</span> Aprendizajes
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-t-lg bg-[#061021] text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-x border-transparent transition-colors"
        >
          <span>⚙️</span> Presets y Hábitos
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-t-lg bg-[#0b1e38] text-cyan-300 font-semibold flex items-center gap-2 border-t-2 border-t-cyan-400 border-x border-cyan-800/80 shadow-[0_-2px_12px_rgba(6,182,212,0.15)]"
        >
          <span>📑</span> Registro y Auditoría
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-t-lg bg-[#061021] text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-x border-transparent transition-colors"
        >
          <span>🎭</span> Monitor Emocional
        </button>
      </div>
      <!-- Window Body Area -->
      <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 bg-[#030713]">
        <!-- Golden Security & Protection Banner -->
        <div
          class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-950/60 via-[#261802] to-amber-950/40 border border-amber-500/50 rounded-lg p-3.5 sm:p-4 text-amber-200 shadow-md mb-4 flex items-center gap-3.5"
        >
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-xl shrink-0 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(245,158,11,0.25)]"
          >
            🔒
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-sora font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-300">
              REGISTRO PROTEGIDO DE SOLO LECTURA
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-amber-200/90 mt-0.5 font-sans leading-relaxed">
              El registro de auditoría de actividad del sistema no se puede modificar ni borrar para preservar la seguridad.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Filter & Actions Toolbar -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 flex-1 min-w-[280px]">
            <!-- Search Input -->
            <div class="relative flex-1 min-w-[180px] max-w-sm">
              <span class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 pl-3 flex items-center pointer-events-none text-cyan-400 text-xs">
                🔍
              </span>
              <input
                type="text"
                placeholder="Filtrar logs..."
                readonly
                class="w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-1.5 bg-[#071326] border border-cyan-900/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono text-slate-200 placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-cyan-400"
              />
            </div>
            <!-- Event Type Selector -->
            <div class="relative">
              <select
                disabled
                class="bg-[#071326] border border-cyan-900/60 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 py-1.5 pl-3 pr-8 appearance-none cursor-pointer focus:outline-none"
              >
                <option>Todos los Tipos de Evento</option>
              </select>
              <span class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 pr-2.5 flex items-center pointer-events-none text-cyan-400 text-[10px]">
                ▼
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Refresh Button -->
          <button
            type="button"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 bg-[#082245] hover:bg-[#0c2f5e] text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-600/50 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-medium transition-colors shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(6,182,212,0.2)]"
          >
            <span>🔄</span> Actualizar Auditoría
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Audit Table Container -->
        <div
          class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-cyan-900/60 bg-[#04091a] shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(23,184,254,0.08)]"
        >
          <div class="min-w-[850px]">
            <table class="w-full text-left font-mono text-xs border-collapse">
              <thead class="bg-[#020b18] text-cyan-400 border-b border-cyan-900/80 sticky top-0 z-10">
                <tr>
                  <th class="py-2.5 px-4 w-44 text-cyan-300 font-semibold border-r border-cyan-950">TIMESTAMP</th>
                  <th class="py-2.5 px-4 w-44 text-cyan-300 font-semibold border-r border-cyan-950">TIPO EVENTO</th>
                  <th class="py-2.5 px-4 w-36 text-cyan-300 font-semibold border-r border-cyan-950">HERRAMIENTA</th>
                  <th class="py-2.5 px-4 text-cyan-300 font-semibold">CONTENIDO DEL LOG</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-cyan-950/40 text-slate-200">
                <!-- Log 1 -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-[#091530]/60 transition-colors bg-[#030713]/40">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-400 border-r border-cyan-950/60 whitespace-nowrap">2026-03-30 08:31:07</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-cyan-950/80 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-700/50">PLANNER</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-500 border-r border-cyan-950/60">-</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-200">El Planner decidió: Ejecutar acción directa sin delegación adicional</td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Log 2 -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-[#091530]/60 transition-colors bg-[#020612]/30">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-400 border-r border-cyan-950/60 whitespace-nowrap">2026-03-30 08:31:07</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-indigo-950/80 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-700/50">INTENCION</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-500 border-r border-cyan-950/60">-</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-200">La intención detectada fue: ACCION</td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Log 3 -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-[#091530]/60 transition-colors bg-[#030713]/40">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-400 border-r border-cyan-950/60 whitespace-nowrap">2026-03-30 08:31:07</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-emerald-950/80 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-700/50">USER</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-500 border-r border-cyan-950/60">-</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-cyan-200 font-medium">El usuario solicitó: Abre el navegador y busca documentación de Astro</td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Log 4 -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-[#091530]/60 transition-colors bg-[#020612]/30">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-400 border-r border-cyan-950/60 whitespace-nowrap">2026-03-30 08:29:45</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-green-950/80 text-green-300 border border-green-700/50">TOOL_SUCCESS</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-950/60 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-800/50 text-[11px]">powershell</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-emerald-300">Ejecución exitosa: Start-Process chrome.exe https://docs.astro.build</td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Log 5 -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-[#091530]/60 transition-colors bg-[#030713]/40">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-400 border-r border-cyan-950/60 whitespace-nowrap">2026-03-30 08:29:44</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-cyan-950/80 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-700/50">PLANNER</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-950/60 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-800/50 text-[11px]">powershell</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-200">Plan: Lanzar navegador web mediante PowerShell de forma segura</td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Log 6 -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-[#091530]/60 transition-colors bg-[#020612]/30">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-400 border-r border-cyan-950/60 whitespace-nowrap">2026-03-30 08:29:43</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-indigo-950/80 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-700/50">INTENCION</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-500 border-r border-cyan-950/60">-</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-200">La intención detectada fue: ACCION_SISTEMA</td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Log 7 -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-[#091530]/60 transition-colors bg-[#030713]/40">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-400 border-r border-cyan-950/60 whitespace-nowrap">2026-03-30 08:28:12</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300 border border-amber-700/50">EJECUCION_HABITO</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-500 border-r border-cyan-950/60">-</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-200">Hábito verificado: Comprobación de integridad de entorno local OK</td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Log 8 -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-[#091530]/60 transition-colors bg-[#020612]/30">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-400 border-r border-cyan-950/60 whitespace-nowrap">2026-03-30 08:27:50</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-fuchsia-950/80 text-fuchsia-300 border border-fuchsia-700/50">APRENDIZAJE</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-500 border-r border-cyan-950/60">-</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-fuchsia-200 font-medium">Nuevo patrón registrado: Preferencia de desarrollo con Astro + Tailwind</td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Log 9 -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-[#091530]/60 transition-colors bg-[#030713]/40">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-400 border-r border-cyan-950/60 whitespace-nowrap">2026-03-30 08:26:30</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-sky-950/80 text-sky-300 border border-sky-700/50">SISTEMA</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-500 border-r border-cyan-950/60">-</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-200">Núcleo de ejecución iniciado: Modelo Gemini 2.5 Pro conectado</td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Log 10 -->
                <tr class="hover:bg-[#091530]/60 transition-colors bg-[#020612]/30">
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 text-slate-400 border-r border-cyan-950/60 whitespace-nowrap">2026-03-30 08:25:00</td>
                  <td class="py-2.5 px-4 border-r border-cyan-950/60">
                    <span class="inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-bold bg-rose-950/80 text-rose-300 border border-rose-700/50">SEGURIDAD</span>
